{
  "$comment": [
    "Spotlight destinations: every place in the app the search bar can take you.",
    "",
    "ADDING A DESTINATION — the only file you need to touch:",
    "  1. Append an object to `destinations` below.",
    "  2. `url_name` must be a real Django URL name (app_namespace:name).",
    "     A typo fails loudly in test_spotlight.py rather than 404ing a user.",
    "  3. `keywords` are what people actually type, including the words we do",
    "     NOT use in the UI — someone searching 'api key' should land on tokens,",
    "     and someone searching '2fa' should land wherever that lives. Synonyms",
    "     are the whole point; the title is already matched separately.",
    "  4. `roles` restricts visibility. Omit for everyone; ['owner','admin']",
    "     for anything a guest must not see.",
    "  5. `args` names URL kwargs the resolver fills from the current session:",
    "     'team_key' is the only one supported today.",
    "",
    "Ordering within a section is by match quality, not by position here.",
    "Sections themselves are ordered by `SECTION_ORDER` in spotlight.py."
  ],
